WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:02.763
(upbeat music)

00:00:13.617 --> 00:00:15.679
- Hi, I'm Hannah, your
friendly neighborhood wine mom

00:00:15.679 --> 00:00:16.792
and if you're anything like me,

00:00:16.792 --> 00:00:18.323
you believe that a glass
of wine at eight p.m.

00:00:18.323 --> 00:00:20.358
makes you a better mom,
so pour yourself a glass

00:00:20.358 --> 00:00:21.365
and let's talk.

00:00:21.365 --> 00:00:24.297
I'm super into these little
personal size bottles lately,

00:00:24.297 --> 00:00:26.512
especially of bubbly.

00:00:26.512 --> 00:00:29.731
This is Prosecco and usually
when you open a whole bottle,

00:00:29.731 --> 00:00:31.627
you kinda need to finish it

00:00:31.627 --> 00:00:34.063
because the bubbles go
away and then it's gross,

00:00:34.063 --> 00:00:36.131
but not when you have these little fools.

00:00:36.131 --> 00:00:37.164
I don't think these have a cork.

00:00:37.164 --> 00:00:39.747
I gotta use a blanket for this.

00:00:41.688 --> 00:00:42.521
Oh.

00:00:43.669 --> 00:00:44.911
Hey.

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:46.682
So there's a topic that's
been running pretty rampant

00:00:46.682 --> 00:00:48.359
on Facebook and I don't understand

00:00:48.359 --> 00:00:50.575
why it's so controversial,

00:00:50.575 --> 00:00:52.077
but we're gonna talk about it tonight.

00:00:52.077 --> 00:00:55.223
So let's discuss the worst
parts about breastfeeding.

00:00:55.223 --> 00:00:56.907
Fair warning, I am pro breastfeeding,

00:00:56.907 --> 00:00:59.020
so if you don't like
it, you've been warned.

00:00:59.020 --> 00:01:00.335
You don't have to watch this.

00:01:00.335 --> 00:01:02.377
You can close it and go on with your day

00:01:02.377 --> 00:01:05.251
and not leave a crappy comment, thanks.

00:01:05.251 --> 00:01:07.115
So first judgy people,

00:01:07.115 --> 00:01:09.976
I don't understand why
other people who either

00:01:09.976 --> 00:01:12.735
don't have children at
all or don't breastfeed

00:01:12.735 --> 00:01:16.617
involve themselves in
this breastfeeding debate.

00:01:16.617 --> 00:01:19.871
Like for example, this guy that
I'm friends with on Facebook

00:01:19.871 --> 00:01:21.986
who doesn't have any children

00:01:21.986 --> 00:01:24.754
posted a status that said, just saw a mom

00:01:24.754 --> 00:01:26.437
nursing on the subway.

00:01:26.437 --> 00:01:27.499
Too much?

00:01:27.499 --> 00:01:28.665
I think so.

00:01:28.665 --> 00:01:30.645
And I saw that and I was like,

00:01:30.645 --> 00:01:32.395
all right mommy time.

00:01:33.413 --> 00:01:36.048
First of all, that mom is
nursing her child on the subway

00:01:36.048 --> 00:01:38.497
for the benefit of everyone around her

00:01:38.497 --> 00:01:40.827
so they don't have to deal
with a shrieking banshee

00:01:40.827 --> 00:01:42.403
for the entire subway ride.

00:01:42.403 --> 00:01:45.703
Second, a mom can't
determine when her child

00:01:45.703 --> 00:01:47.551
is going to be hungry.

00:01:47.551 --> 00:01:50.145
I would like to see you try reasoning

00:01:50.145 --> 00:01:51.818
with a newborn.

00:01:51.818 --> 00:01:54.297
No, now is not the time
that you're allowed to eat.

00:01:54.297 --> 00:01:57.493
You're gonna have to wait
till mom's at home alone

00:01:57.493 --> 00:01:58.995
in privacy.

00:01:58.995 --> 00:01:59.872
Good luck.

00:01:59.872 --> 00:02:03.171
Also, people act is if women
go to breastfeed their kids

00:02:03.171 --> 00:02:05.069
and are just like breastfeeding time.

00:02:05.069 --> 00:02:06.922
Everyone's husband gather round.

00:02:06.922 --> 00:02:08.569
Time for the booby show.

00:02:08.569 --> 00:02:09.713
Like, no.

00:02:09.713 --> 00:02:11.614
The goal is not to give
someone a free show

00:02:11.614 --> 00:02:14.149
and the amount of breast
that actually shows

00:02:14.149 --> 00:02:15.650
is like a bikini.

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:17.056
So if you're cool going to the beach

00:02:17.056 --> 00:02:18.092
and not going up to women,

00:02:18.092 --> 00:02:20.078
like how indecent of you.

00:02:20.078 --> 00:02:21.457
Leave the breastfeeding mom alone.

00:02:21.457 --> 00:02:24.048
The whole point of breasts
are to feed children

00:02:24.048 --> 00:02:25.949
and if you can't separate
what the breast's

00:02:25.949 --> 00:02:29.430
actual function is from what
you would like them to be,

00:02:29.430 --> 00:02:31.820
maybe you shouldn't be in public at all.

00:02:31.820 --> 00:02:33.336
I can't believe that this is even a thing

00:02:33.336 --> 00:02:35.187
that people get mad about.

00:02:35.187 --> 00:02:36.020
End rant.

00:02:38.171 --> 00:02:39.889
It's hard to drink this quickly.

00:02:39.889 --> 00:02:41.515
That's my only issue.

00:02:41.515 --> 00:02:43.976
Next, the ever changing girls.

00:02:43.976 --> 00:02:47.232
I would buy bras and
one hour they would fit

00:02:47.232 --> 00:02:49.098
and then the next hour they'd be too small

00:02:49.098 --> 00:02:51.055
and then the next hour they'd be too big

00:02:51.055 --> 00:02:53.011
and then the next hour
they would fit again.

00:02:53.011 --> 00:02:55.150
They're changing in size every hour

00:02:55.150 --> 00:02:57.207
based on how much milk there is

00:02:57.207 --> 00:02:59.248
and then when they're too full,

00:02:59.248 --> 00:03:02.175
they just pour milk everywhere.

00:03:02.175 --> 00:03:03.653
I can't even tell you how many times

00:03:03.653 --> 00:03:05.902
I was having a conversation with a person

00:03:05.902 --> 00:03:09.014
and their eyes just slowly went like.

00:03:09.014 --> 00:03:11.098
And it's because my shirt was soaked.

00:03:11.098 --> 00:03:13.660
Like I had two big wet balls.

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:14.622
Come on.

00:03:14.622 --> 00:03:16.296
Like I would get to the point of just like

00:03:16.296 --> 00:03:17.872
shoving paper towels in there.

00:03:17.872 --> 00:03:19.596
I was like a high schooler again.

00:03:19.596 --> 00:03:21.771
Just like stuffing my
bra with paper towels.

00:03:21.771 --> 00:03:22.812
Nothing to see here.

00:03:22.812 --> 00:03:24.789
Don't touch 'em 'cause it'll crinkle.

00:03:24.789 --> 00:03:27.347
I'm really grateful to be past
the whole breastfeeding phase

00:03:27.347 --> 00:03:29.137
because now my breasts
can go back to the way

00:03:29.137 --> 00:03:32.306
that they once were, which
apparently is nothing.

00:03:32.306 --> 00:03:35.079
Cheers to what they once were.

00:03:35.079 --> 00:03:36.329
Next, pumping.

00:03:36.329 --> 00:03:38.911
If you ever were wondering
what the life is like

00:03:38.911 --> 00:03:41.310
as a dairy cow, have a baby and pump.

00:03:41.310 --> 00:03:44.299
Hee haw, hee haw, hee haw.

00:03:44.299 --> 00:03:46.183
After all the advances in technology,

00:03:46.183 --> 00:03:47.701
you'd think that these pumps would be

00:03:47.701 --> 00:03:49.143
a little bit quiet.

00:03:49.143 --> 00:03:51.743
Why are the pumps still so goddamn loud?

00:03:51.743 --> 00:03:53.673
One time we were camping.

00:03:53.673 --> 00:03:55.688
So I'm trying to
discretely pump in our tent

00:03:55.688 --> 00:03:58.032
and everybody's like
what the heck is that?

00:03:58.032 --> 00:04:00.118
Hee haw, hee haw.

00:04:00.118 --> 00:04:01.680
Is she drilling something in there?

00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:04.122
Like what hee haw, hee haw.

00:04:04.122 --> 00:04:06.203
They have these cups that go over

00:04:06.203 --> 00:04:08.549
and they're like these little
cones that you stick over

00:04:08.549 --> 00:04:11.537
and they like yank your boobs in and out.

00:04:11.537 --> 00:04:13.790
I made the biggest mistake
of looking at myself

00:04:13.790 --> 00:04:16.001
in the mirror while I was pumping once.

00:04:16.001 --> 00:04:17.854
(groaning)

00:04:17.854 --> 00:04:19.295
It's not pretty.

00:04:19.295 --> 00:04:21.571
Next, the thirst is real.

00:04:21.571 --> 00:04:24.149
With both of my kids, the
weirdest thing happened.

00:04:24.149 --> 00:04:27.282
Every time I went to nurse
them and they latched

00:04:27.282 --> 00:04:30.047
I would just get like beyond thirsty.

00:04:30.047 --> 00:04:32.430
Like deserted island, haven't had water

00:04:32.430 --> 00:04:34.312
in three days thirsty.

00:04:34.312 --> 00:04:36.100
I never had the thought to be like,

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:37.954
oh I should probably get some water

00:04:37.954 --> 00:04:41.519
and like leave it near
me for when I'm nursing.

00:04:41.519 --> 00:04:43.979
Once your kid latches it's like game over,

00:04:43.979 --> 00:04:45.839
you're stuck for a good half an hour.

00:04:45.839 --> 00:04:50.195
So I'd try to signal
my husband, like Matt.

00:04:50.195 --> 00:04:51.028
Matt.

00:04:52.028 --> 00:04:52.861
Matt.

00:04:52.861 --> 00:04:55.454
And I'm pretty sure it's a
reflex that your body has

00:04:55.454 --> 00:04:58.257
to make sure that you're
hydrating while you're nursing

00:04:58.257 --> 00:05:00.881
because making breast
milk takes so much water.

00:05:00.881 --> 00:05:02.005
So if this has happened to you,

00:05:02.005 --> 00:05:03.223
please leave it in the comments

00:05:03.223 --> 00:05:06.127
because I'm super confused
about it to this day

00:05:06.127 --> 00:05:09.117
and I wanna know that I'm not alone.

00:05:09.117 --> 00:05:09.950
(burps)

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:11.283
Oh, there it is.

00:05:12.301 --> 00:05:13.662
(burps)

00:05:13.662 --> 00:05:15.553
So last, the end.

00:05:15.553 --> 00:05:17.010
When it's time to wean your child,

00:05:17.010 --> 00:05:19.198
it is a bundle of mixed emotions.

00:05:19.198 --> 00:05:20.872
You're happy to have your boobs back.

00:05:20.872 --> 00:05:22.291
You're sad because then your child

00:05:22.291 --> 00:05:24.141
is not depending on you anymore.

00:05:24.141 --> 00:05:27.196
My first child nursed forever

00:05:27.196 --> 00:05:29.253
and it got to a point where I had to say

00:05:29.253 --> 00:05:32.927
you're eating like three
adult size meals a day.

00:05:32.927 --> 00:05:34.003
It's time.

00:05:34.003 --> 00:05:36.908
And then with my youngest,
he was exclusively breastfed

00:05:36.908 --> 00:05:39.556
until he was eight months old
and then I got a full-time job

00:05:39.556 --> 00:05:41.419
and I just had to quit cold turkey

00:05:41.419 --> 00:05:43.590
because being a working
mom is really tough

00:05:43.590 --> 00:05:46.577
and then trying to pump on
top of it is even tougher.

00:05:46.577 --> 00:05:49.212
I was the one who suffered more from that

00:05:49.212 --> 00:05:51.576
because I just felt so badly about it.

00:05:51.576 --> 00:05:52.663
He didn't really care.

00:05:52.663 --> 00:05:56.578
He was like, milk's in a
bottle today, all right.

00:05:56.578 --> 00:05:58.210
After both of those experiences,

00:05:58.210 --> 00:06:00.913
I realized that no matter
how my baby is getting fed,

00:06:00.913 --> 00:06:03.104
as long as he's being fed, that's good

00:06:03.104 --> 00:06:04.453
and I'm doing a good job.

00:06:04.453 --> 00:06:05.497
And for any moms out there

00:06:05.497 --> 00:06:07.109
who are struggling with breastfeeding

00:06:07.109 --> 00:06:08.827
or who have had to stop breastfeeding

00:06:08.827 --> 00:06:10.410
or who couldn't from the start,

00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:11.712
you're doing fine too,

00:06:11.712 --> 00:06:14.154
but if you are a person

00:06:14.154 --> 00:06:16.543
who's gonna judge a mother for nursing,

00:06:16.543 --> 00:06:20.022
just know that she is
not doing it for anything

00:06:20.022 --> 00:06:23.393
besides the soul purpose
of benefiting her child.

00:06:23.393 --> 00:06:25.320
So either give her a high five

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:26.487
or walk on by.

00:06:27.366 --> 00:06:28.621
So that's all I got for today.

00:06:28.621 --> 00:06:30.752
I'm Hannah your friendly
neighborhood wine mom

00:06:30.752 --> 00:06:33.044
and if you've had any
experience breastfeeding

00:06:33.044 --> 00:06:35.239
or lack thereof, leave it in the comments

00:06:35.239 --> 00:06:38.464
because this couch, this is a safe place.

00:06:38.464 --> 00:06:40.483
I wanna hear about everyone's experience

00:06:40.483 --> 00:06:42.881
and I don't want anybody to feel judged.

00:06:42.881 --> 00:06:45.724
And I'm gonna enjoy the rest
of my little personal bottle

00:06:45.724 --> 00:06:46.653
of champagne.

00:06:46.653 --> 00:06:49.450
It's so cute, while I still can.

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:50.440
While I still can.

00:06:50.440 --> 00:06:51.613
Oh that sounds like I'm getting--

00:06:51.613 --> 00:06:53.771
I'm not getting pregnant, stop.

00:06:53.771 --> 00:06:54.937
Kevin, don't give me that look.

00:06:54.937 --> 00:06:57.420
Kevin's behind the camera like.

00:06:57.420 --> 00:06:59.313
Not having any babies soon.

00:06:59.313 --> 00:07:03.894
So I'm going to finish my
little cute bottle of champagne

00:07:03.894 --> 00:07:06.302
because I can and 'cause I earned it.

00:07:06.302 --> 00:07:09.980
And this one is for all of you
women breastfeeding out there

00:07:09.980 --> 00:07:11.563
and all of you pregnant women out there

00:07:11.563 --> 00:07:13.895
'cause I know a lot of
pregnant women watch this

00:07:13.895 --> 00:07:16.424
and this one's for you and as
soon as you pop that baby out

00:07:16.424 --> 00:07:18.578
come over and have a glass with me.

00:07:18.578 --> 00:07:19.855
Till next time.

00:07:19.855 --> 00:07:21.992
(upbeat music)

00:07:21.992 --> 00:07:24.159
(moaning)

00:07:25.364 --> 00:07:27.764
Please include this

00:07:27.764 --> 00:07:31.014
just so everyone knows how pretty I am.

